(Simmons and Gallo, 2024), and intercellular communication with adjacent melanocytes (Marrapodi and Bellei, 2024).\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4052061 <https://orcid.org/0009-0000-8480-9277>)\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4052061 \"2025-07-02T12:32:13Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4052061 \"keratincyte of epidermis\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:39185948\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4052061 \"skin keratinocyte\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:15749908\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19727116\") rdfs:comment obo:CL_4052061 \"Keratinocytes are reportedly CDw210a(IL-10RA)-negative , CDw210b(IL-10RB)-positive, IL22Ra1-positive, Human keratinocytes are reportedly capable of secreting BD-2, BD-3, hCAP-18, CXCL1, CXCL5, CXCL8, elafin, MMP-3, NGAL, PDGF-A, S100A7, S100A8, and S100A9. Transcription factors: STAT3-positive.\")\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
